      en: ["Highest elevation is Loma Vieja at approximately 736 meters", "Primary watershed for the provinces of El Seibo and Hato Mayor", "Geological formations date back mostly to the Late Cretaceous", "The region is renowned for its extensive cattle ranching operations", "Significant area for the production of organic cacao", "Serves as a natural barrier between the coastline and the interior plains"],
